<span class="block text-sm font-bold tabular-nums">₱48,230.55</span>
<span class="block text-[11px] font-medium text-pretty">Forty-Eight Thousand Two Hundred Thirty Pesos and 55/100 Only</span>
</span>
</div>
<table class="my-2 w-full border-collapse border border-paper-ink">
